@startuml
title Composite structure: Items API component

component "Items API" as ItemsAPI {
  component "handleItems()\n(HTTP handler)" as Handler {
    port " " as HttpPort
  }
  component "getItems()\n(SQL batch: lock, create, seed, select)" as GetItems
  component "getPool()\n(cached ConnectionPool)" as Pool {
    port " " as SqlPort
  }

  Handler --> GetItems
  GetItems --> Pool
}

note right of Pool
  poolPromise is a module-level cache: one
  pooled connection reused across invocations
  (items.ts:10-41).
end note

@enduml
